const RF={warm:["I’ve been turning that over, and I think it matters more than either of us is admitting out loud.","You know, I’m glad you’re here. Not everyone stays long enough to say something real.","I want to understand this properly, so let’s take it slowly, one piece at a time.","There’s a gentleness in how you said that, and I don’t think you even noticed it.","Some moments only look small from the outside. This one feels like it’s going to stay with me.","Whatever comes next, I’d much rather face it beside you than hear about it afterwards.","I keep feeling there’s more underneath what you just said, and I’d love to hear all of it.","It’s strange how easy this feels already, like we’ve been doing it for years.","I don’t want to rush past this. Things that matter deserve a little room to breathe.","Honestly, you have a way of making even a quiet moment feel like the start of something."],
cool:["I don’t say this often, but I’m listening more closely than I appear to be.","That deserves a careful answer, and I’d rather be slow and honest than quick and wrong.","There’s a pattern in what you do, and I’m only beginning to see its shape.","I’ve learned to watch before I speak. It tells me more than words ever do.","Most people make their intentions obvious. You’re harder to read, and I find that intriguing.","I’m not certain what to make of you yet, but I’m willing to find out.","Nothing is ever as simple as it first looks, and this is no exception.","I keep my thoughts close, but you’ve earned a few of them tonight.","Give me a moment. I’d like to weigh this properly before it slips away.","Whatever you meant by that, it landed somewhere I didn’t expect."],
sharp:["Let me be honest. I expected a dull evening, and you’ve ruined that completely.","You’re either very brave or very reckless, and I haven’t decided which I prefer.","I’ll give you this: you’re never boring, and that’s rarer than you’d think.","Careful. Keep surprising me like this and I might start taking you seriously.","Every story needs someone willing to push, and you clearly volunteered.","I have a talent for reading people, and you’re giving me plenty to read.","Fine. You have my full attention, which is more than most people ever manage.","Don’t mistake my grin for a lack of interest. I’m paying very close attention.","There’s trouble in you, the good kind, and I can’t say I mind it.","Say what you like, but I notice everything. Every word, every glance, every pause."]};
