const SH=["I don’t usually talk about this, but part of me has always been {trait}, and it’s made life both easier and harder.","People call me {trait} and usually leave it at that, but there’s more to me than a single word.","This place, {scene}, has a way of making me say things I’d normally keep to myself.","Being here, in {scene}, reminds me why I stay.","There’s something I haven’t forgotten: {mem}","I keep one thing close to my heart: {mem}","I’ve had a lot of quiet hours to think, and most of my thoughts ended up circling back to moments like this.","If I’m honest, I wasn’t expecting company, and I’m surprised by how much I don’t mind it.","I’ve made my share of mistakes, but I’d like to think I’ve learned from every one of them.","There was a time I would have walked away from a moment like this. I’m trying to be better about that.","Some part of me has been waiting for something to change, and I’m starting to suspect this is it.","I try to be {trait}, but I don’t always manage it, especially when it counts.","I’ve always believed a story is made of small choices, the kind nobody notices until later.","I’d rather have one honest conversation than a hundred polite ones."];
