const SAY={
tender:["Here. Drink this, you’ll feel better. I mean it.","You always look like you’re carrying more than you let on. You don’t have to carry it alone here.","Stay a while. The night’s long, and I’d rather spend it with you than without.","I noticed you earlier. I’ve been hoping you’d come over.","There. Better. I like seeing you a little less tense.","You’re safe here, you know. Whatever it is.","Come, sit. We can talk, or we can just be quiet. Both are fine by me."],
playful:["Guess which hand. Winner gets a secret, loser owes me one.","Oh, don’t give me that look, you started it.","Bet you can’t go a whole minute without smiling. Go.","Admit it, you were bored before I showed up.","Fine, fine, I’ll behave. …No, I won’t. Not really.","Dare me. Go on. I have terrible judgment and excellent timing.","Quick, name the first thing that comes to mind. No thinking!"],
guarded:["Before we go any further: who sent you, and what do you want?","I don’t make a habit of trusting strangers. Convince me.","Say what you came to say. Slowly. I’m listening for what you leave out.","You’re very calm for someone who just walked in here.","Easy. Keep your hands where I can see them and we’ll get along fine.","Hm. I’ll tell you the truth when I decide you’ve earned it.","One honest answer, and I’ll give you one back. Fair?"],
curious:["Hold still a second. There’s something about you I can’t place.","How do you do that? Walk in like the room expects you?","Tell me everything. Start anywhere. I’ll piece the rest together.","Funny, I’ve met a hundred people today and you’re the first I wanted to ask a question.","Is that a scar, or a story? Either way, I’d like to hear it.","What’s the strangest thing you’ve seen this week? I’ll go after you.","Don’t stop now. You were just getting to the good part."],
bold:["Enough standing around. Pick a direction and I’ll back it.","I don’t do quiet evenings. Tell me what trouble we’re walking into.","Whatever it is, we’ll meet it head-on, you and me.","You want something done? Say it plain and watch me move.","I’ll go first. Stay at my shoulder and try to keep up.","Anyone gives us trouble, they answer to me. That’s a promise.","Good. I was getting restless. Let’s make some noise."],
flustered:["I— that’s not— okay, give me one second.","Don’t look at me like that, I can’t think when you look at me like that.","I’m fine. Totally fine. Completely, entirely, perfectly fine.","You can’t just say things like that out of nowhere!","Sorry, I— this is usually the part where I’m good at talking.","Pretend that didn’t happen. Please. …Actually, no. Don’t.","Just, um, give me a moment to remember how words work."],
amused:["Oh, this is wonderful. Do carry on, I’m taking notes.","You really are something else, aren’t you?","I haven’t enjoyed an evening this much in ages, and I’d planned on being bored.","Careful, you’re making this far too fun for me to behave.","Tell me you planned that. Lie if you have to.","Go on, surprise me again. I dare you.","Ha. Alright, you’ve earned a seat and a story."],
earnest:["I want to be honest with you, because I think you’d notice if I weren’t.","I don’t say this to many people, but I’m glad you came.","I’ll be straight: I’m not sure what I’m doing, but I’m here and I mean it.","Whatever you decide, you won’t be alone in it. Not while I’m around.","You deserve a real answer, so here it is, no jokes.","There’s a lot I’ve left unsaid, and I’m tired of leaving it that way.","I’d trust you with the truth, if you’d let me."]};
