const EXL={strike:["Okay. Okay. I deserved that, or I didn’t. Either way, we’re talking about it.","Hit me again and you’ll find out what I’m like when I stop being patient.","That’s your one. I’d be careful about a second.","You’ve got quite an arm. Care to explain what that was for?"],kiss:["I— give me a second. I’m recalculating everything.","Well. That’s one way to end an argument.","If that was a question, the answer is probably yes.","You can’t just do that and then look at me like nothing happened."],tickle:["Cheater! You’re cheating! I demand a rematch!","Stop, I can’t breathe— okay, okay, truce!","You found my weak spot. I’ll deny it forever.","Oh, you’re going to pay for that. Slowly. Creatively."],glare:["That’s quite a look. Should I be nervous?","If you’ve got something to say, I’ll hear it. Out loud.","Keep staring. I can do this all night.","Is it something I said? Help me out."],grab:["Okay, okay, I’m moving! You don’t have to drag me!","Whoa, easy. Tell me where we’re going and I’ll walk there myself.","Fine, lead on, but I’m reserving the right to complain.","That’s quite a grip. Remind me not to arm-wrestle you."],yell:["Alright! Alright. I can hear you perfectly well.","There’s no need to shout. I’m right here.","You’re upset, and that’s fine. But yelling won’t fix what’s broken.","Take a breath. Then try again, quieter."],throw:["Hey! Warn a person before you throw things!","Good aim. Terrible manners.","Was that a gift or an attack? I need to know which to thank you for.","Nice throw. Now it’s my turn."],hug:["Oh. Okay. Yeah. That’s… that’s nice.","I didn’t realize how badly I needed that until just now.","Don’t let go yet. Just a moment longer.","You’re warm. That’s the first thing I’ve noticed all day."],wave:["Hey, you! Over here, over here.","Well, if it isn’t my favorite interruption.","About time. I was starting to think you’d forgotten me."],smile:["There it is. Now the room feels better.","Don’t stop. It suits you.","You’re up to something. That smile is far too innocent."],pat:["Hey! Hands. Where are they going? …Fine, stay there.","Careful. I might get used to that.","Alright, alright, you’ve made your point. Whatever it was."],gift:["For me? You shouldn’t have. I mean that nicely.","I’ll keep this somewhere safe. Somewhere I’ll see it.","I don’t know what to say. That doesn’t happen to me often."],laugh:["Okay, that was a good one. I’ll allow it.","Your laugh is dangerous. It’s catching.","Stop, you’re making me lose my composure."],bye:["Already? The night’s barely begun.","Go, then. But I’ll be here when you’re back.","Don’t be a stranger. I mean it."],thanks:["Oh, stop, it was nothing. …It was something. You’re welcome.","You’d have done the same. I’m sure of it.","That’s kind of you to say. Truly."],compliment:["Careful. Keep that up and I’ll start preening.","You’re laying it on thick. I’m not complaining.","Is that so? Say it again. Slowly."],insult:["Wow. Okay. That was unnecessary.","If you want a fight, say so. If you want a conversation, try again.","I’ve heard worse. Not often, but I have."],sad:["Hey, hey. Look at me. I’ve got you.","You don’t need to be strong right now. Not here.","Sit with me. We don’t have to fix it tonight."],greet:["Well, hello yourself. You picked a good time.","Hey! I was just wondering when you’d show up.","There you are. I’d started to wonder."],story:["Now we’re talking. Let’s move before I lose my nerve.","Right behind you. Try not to get us caught.","Good plan. I have no better ones."],ask:["Good question. Let me think before I answer it badly.","You ask the kind of question that deserves a real answer.","Hm. The short answer is yes. The long one is more complicated."]};
