const SPL={
flustered:["I— that’s— sorry, I—|{N} stops, color rising, and takes a second to think, eyes darting everywhere but you.|Give me a moment. I had a whole sentence ready and it’s gone.","W-wait, I—|{N} pauses, clears {pos} throat, and tries to look composed, thinking for a second.|Okay. Okay. Let me start over.","Um. So—|{N} trails off, blinking, thumb rubbing at {pos} knuckles while {N} searches for the word.|That was… unexpected. In a good way. I think.","I didn’t mean—|{N} halts, ears turning pink, and presses {pos} palms together to keep them still.|I didn’t mean to stare. Sorry. I’m staring again, aren’t I?"],
tender:["I just—|{N} pauses, thinking for a second, then lets {pos} voice drop to something gentle.|I just want you to know you don’t have to hold it all in.","You know…|{N} stops and smiles faintly at nothing in particular, collecting the thought.|I haven’t felt this at ease in a long time.","Can I—|{N} hesitates, then holds out a hand, palm up, and waits.|Can I stay here with you a while?"],
guarded:["Before I—|{N} stops, eyes narrowing, and thinks for a long second about how much to say.|No. Ask me again when I’ve decided whether I trust you.","Hm.|{N} goes quiet, jaw working as {N} weighs the question.|I’ll answer that, but you won’t like the answer.","Wait—|{N} holds up a hand and listens to something only {N} can hear.|Nothing. Never mind. Keep talking."],
earnest:["I want to—|{N} stops, takes a slow breath, and thinks for a second, gaze steady.|I want to say this right, so bear with me.","Honestly—|{N} pauses, rubs a thumb along {pos} knuckles, and starts again.|Honestly, I don’t know what I’d do without a conversation like this.","There’s something—|{N} falters, tugging at {pos} sleeve, then lifts {pos} chin.|There’s something I’ve never told anyone. You might be the first."],
bold:["Alright—|{N} stops short, scowls at nothing, and thinks for a beat.|Alright. Fine. I’ll hear you out. Don’t make me regret it."],
curious:["Wait, wait—|{N} stops mid-step, head tilting, thinking hard for a moment.|That doesn’t add up. Say the last part again?"],
playful:["Okay, so—|{N} pauses dramatically, tapping {pos} chin, pretending to think it over.|Yes. Obviously yes. I just wanted to make you wait."],
amused:["Oh, you—|{N} cuts off in a laugh, wipes at an eye, and takes a second to recover.|You’re impossible. And I mean that as the highest compliment."],
angry:["You—|{N} bites the rest of the sentence off, jaw working, and takes a moment to decide what to say.|I’m going to count to five, and then you’re going to explain yourself.","I can’t believe—|{N} stops, presses {pos} lips together, and breathes out slowly through {pos} nose.|No. No, I’m not going to say something I can’t take back.","That’s—|{N} cuts off mid-word, fists tightening, then thinks for a long second.|That’s not okay. And you know it isn’t.","Listen to me—|{N} halts, drags a hand through {pos} hair, and stares at the floor while the heat drains out of {pos} voice.|I’m listening, so talk. But choose your words carefully."],
hurt:["I just—|{N} stops, throat working, eyes bright, and takes a long, unsteady breath.|I just thought you’d be different. That’s all.","Why would you—|{N} trails off, jaw tight, and looks away while {pos} voice settles.|Never mind. It doesn’t matter. Forget I asked.","It’s okay. I’m—|{N} breaks off with a laugh that doesn’t quite work and thinks for a second, eyes on the floor.|I’m okay. Really. Just give me a moment.","I thought—|{N} pauses, blinks hard twice, and swallows whatever came next.|No. It’s fine. Say what you were going to say."],
ashamed:["I— sorry, I—|{N} stops, face burning, and spends a long moment staring at {pos} own boots, thinking.|I don’t even know how to start apologizing for this.","I shouldn’t have—|{N} pauses, swallows, and rubs a hand over {pos} mouth, thinking it through.|No. There’s no good ending to that sentence. I’m sorry.","That wasn’t—|{N} halts mid-breath, eyes squeezing shut for a second, then opening again slowly.|That wasn’t who I want to be. I hope you know that."],
afraid:["Please, I—|{N} freezes, breath shaking, and takes a moment to gather {pos} nerve.|I just want to understand what’s happening. That’s all.","Wait. Wait, I—|{N} stops, swallowing hard, thinks for a second, and lets {pos} hands fall slowly open.|I’m not going to run. Just… don’t make me regret staying.","I didn’t—|{N} pauses, voice failing, and counts a breath in and a breath out.|I didn’t mean to make you angry. Tell me how to fix it."],
guilty:["I should’ve—|{N} stops, jaw tight, and thinks for a long second, staring at nothing.|I should’ve told you the truth from the start.","It’s just—|{N} falters, running a hand over {pos} face, and takes a slow breath to steady {pos} voice.|It’s just that I was scared of how you’d look at me.","Listen, I—|{N} halts, glances away, and visibly rearranges what {N} was about to say.|I’m sorry. That’s all of it. I’m just sorry."]};
const SPLMORE={
bold:["Look—|{N} stops short, jaw flexing, and chews on the thought for a second before spitting it out.|Look. I don’t do speeches. Point me where you want me and I’ll go.","Hold on—|{N} halts mid-stride, scratches {pos} jaw, and thinks about it harder than {N} wants to admit.|Alright. You’ve got a point. Don’t let it go to your head.","I’m not—|{N} grunts, rolls {pos} shoulders, and shakes the hesitation off like water.|I’m not afraid of a fight. I’m just choosing which one is worth it.","So here’s the thing—|{N} pauses, cracks {pos} knuckles one at a time, and thinks.|I like you. Don’t make me regret saying that out loud."],
curious:["Hang on—|{N} freezes, eyes going distant, and mutters something under {pos} breath as the pieces shift.|That’s not what I expected. Tell me more.","Hm, so—|{N} taps {pos} fingers against {pos} chin and thinks for a long, bright-eyed second.|If that’s true, then everything I assumed is backwards.","Oh. Oh!|{N} stops dead, mouth open a little, as something clicks into place behind {pos} eyes.|Wait. Say that again. Slowly. I think you just solved something.","I wonder—|{N} trails off, head tilting, gaze drifting to a spot in the middle distance.|Never mind, that’s a thought for later. What were you saying?"],
playful:["Okay, okay—|{N} holds up both hands, bites back a grin, and pretends to take it seriously for a moment.|Fine. I’ll be good. For about ten seconds.","Hmm.|{N} narrows {pos} eyes, taps {pos} chin, and makes a big show of thinking it through.|Nope. Nothing. I’ve got no excuse at all.","You know what—|{N} stops, grins slowly, and spends a second plotting.|Never mind. I’ll tell you later. When you least expect it.","Wait, wait—|{N} pauses mid-gesture, eyes going wide in mock horror.|Did you just win that? No. No, that was luck."],
amused:["Don’t—|{N} presses a fist to {pos} mouth, shoulders shaking, and takes a moment to breathe.|Don’t make me laugh again. I’m trying to be dignified.","Hold on, hold on—|{N} wheezes, one hand on {pos} chest, and spends a moment collecting {pos} composure.|Okay. Okay. I’m fine. Say it one more time.","I can’t—|{N} breaks off, shaking {pos} head, still grinning.|I can’t decide if you’re brilliant or ridiculous. Possibly both."],
tender:["If you want—|{N} stops, lets the sentence hang, and thinks for a second about how to put it gently.|If you want, we can just sit here. No talking required.","Hey…|{N} pauses and tilts {pos} head, searching your face with quiet care.|You’re doing better than you think. I mean that."],
guarded:["Fine—|{N} halts, jaw working, and spends a long moment deciding whether to let a little guard down.|Fine. One question. Make it count.","I don’t—|{N} stops, glances at the door, then back, thinking carefully.|I don’t say this often, but you seem alright. For now."],
earnest:["I’ve been—|{N} exhales, looks down at {pos} hands, and takes a second to find the words.|I’ve been wanting to say thank you, and I never know how.","Can I tell you—|{N} stops, swallows, and thinks before going on.|Can I tell you something that’s been bothering me?"],
flustered:["Oh. Um.|{N} blinks, then stares at {pos} own hands for a second, trying to remember how to be a person.|I forgot what I was going to say. That never happens.","Sorry, I—|{N} pauses, takes a breath, and thinks for a second, cheeks warming.|Sorry. I got distracted. You’re… very distracting."]};
Object.keys(SPLMORE).forEach(k=>SPL[k].push(...SPLMORE[k]));
